{
  "comment": "The README's shot list, run by tools/demo/demo.py. Sessions run in order, each a fresh app with its own state; within a session one step's leftovers are the next step's state. Steps are documented at the top of crates/app/examples/demo.rs.",
  "window": {"width": 1180, "height": 700},
